  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Chimani Honey Processing Capacity Building Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Honey and others (Pure forest Honey, sorghum, dried vegetables , sunflower unrefined cookig oil) Beneficiries: 4015 Males and 1614 Females. The group seeks to improve their competitiveness through increasing their purchases by adding a revolving purchase fund . Enhance honey processing efficiency through purchases of an automatic processing machine. Organic certifiation and Standards Association of Zimbabwe quaility certification enables export marketing to both regional and international markets.</narrative>
  </description>
